      "writtenOn": "2025-05-28T15:19:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My main concern was that afaik we can\u0027t return `-EINTR` to user space because e.g. `TEMP_FAILURE_RETRY` will immediately retry the syscall. Doesn\u0027t crosvm do the equivalent (in Rust)?\n\n`-EAGAIN` might be better but I\u0027m not sure how much.",
      "parentUuid": "269a428e_5bd18e30",
      "range": {
