        "id": 1569742
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-28T15:35:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While at it, please move the sending of the destruction message to the \u0027if (nr_busy)\u0027 section further down this function. That will allow Linux to reclaim the majority of guest pages that are not \u0027tainted\u0027 by FF-A early, and then to deal with the potentially slow FF-A related logic in a second step.",
      "parentUuid": "592d63d7_5e2e9368",
      "revId": "876d72fcb57ebf61c6e5305e98f984a7587d1f2c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
